[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6204745412","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124520#issuecomment-6204745412","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124520","id":6204745412,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABcdTmxA","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-15T23:54:06Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T23:54:06Z","body":"cc @dsnopek , if you could have a look once you have your Steam Frame that be great. I've got it on my list to look at as well.\n\nNote, workaround for anyone experiencing this is to turn off subsampled images when exporting to Steam Frame.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6204745412/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6223946976","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124520#issuecomment-6223946976","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124520","id":6223946976,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABcvnk4A","user":{"login":"vilhalmer","id":201439,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTQzOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201439?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vilhalmer","html_url":"https://github.com/vilhalmer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vilhalmer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vilhalmer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vilhalmer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vilhalmer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vilhalmer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vilhalmer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vilhalmer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vilhalmer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vilhalmer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-16T20:19:44Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T20:19:44Z","body":"I've been experimenting with this after finding that downgrading to 4.7.2 fixed it for me despite the defaults being the same. In 4.7.2 you have to actually enable foveation for it to happen, but in 4.8 beta 1, having `xr/openxr/foveation_with_subsampled_images` enabled is enough to trigger it even with foveation off.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6223946976/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6319450010","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124520#issuecomment-6319450010","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124520","id":6319450010,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABeKsnmg","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-21T15:13:36Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T15:13:36Z","body":"I've been able to reproduce this on Steam Frame, including what @vilhalmer says about the issue not happening on 4.7.2 if foveation is disabled, but still happening with `master` (679066724352c12673001d692d41dc2dab9314c0), meaning this is confirmed to be a regression in 4.8. Disabling the subsampled images option does seem to make the issue go away.\n\nThis is really weird, though, because with https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124344, the subsampled option shouldn't change how we render at all if foveation is disabled\n\nI'll keep looking into it!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6319450010/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6321034965","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124520#issuecomment-6321034965","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124520","id":6321034965,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABeMNW1Q","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-21T16:29:10Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T16:29:10Z","body":"I just posted PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124747 which fixes the regression part of this issue, so Godot 4.8 will work the same as Godot 4.7.2, and enabling \"Foveation with Subsampled Images\" will have no effect unless foveation is actually enabled\n\nHowever, it doesn't fix the actual \"image warp\" on Steam Frame - I'm still trying to figure that out...","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6321034965/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6327739807","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124520#issuecomment-6327739807","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124520","id":6327739807,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABeSmlnw","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-21T22:15:31Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T18:03:03Z","body":"In my testing, it appears that disabling \"Foveation Eye Tracked\" also eliminates the \"image warp\".\n\nSo, these configurations work (ie they don't warp the image):\n\n- Foveation + Subsampled Images\n- Foveation + Eye Tracked\n\nBut this one does NOT work (ie the image is warped):\n\n- Foveation + Subsampled Images + Eye Tracked\n\nI'm starting to suspect that this may have more to do with eye-tracking than subsampled images (ie maybe eye-tracked foveated rendering isn't working right on Frame, but we can only really see that when subsampled images are enabled to warp the image), but I still need to investigate further","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6327739807/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6329671108","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124520#issuecomment-6329671108","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124520","id":6329671108,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABeUcdxA","user":{"login":"DanielKinsman","id":15639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman","html_url":"https://github.com/DanielKinsman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-22T00:28:27Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T00:35:54Z","body":"> maybe eye-tracked foveated rendering isn't working right on Frame, but we can only really see that when subsampled images are enabled to warp the image\n\nIn my testing it isn't working *at all*, at least not when subpasses are enabled. But it isn't just eye tracked fov rendering, *any* kind of foveation or vrs has absolutely no effect on either the rendered output or performance (apart from causing the warping, apparently).\n\nEDIT: ooh actually disabling subpasses with FXAA \"fixes\" the warping! Maybe the same underlying cause is behind both this issue and #124141","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6329671108/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]